.TH mnnn-org-template-save 1  "mnnn-org-template-save 2.15.0" 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
mnnn\-org\-template\-save \- Save a template (placeholders: {{title}} {{org.name}} {{org.description}} {{content}} {{css}} {{assets}} {{base}})
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmnnn org template save\fR [\fB\-\-home\fR] <\fB\-\-html\fR> [\fB\-\-css\fR] [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR] [\fB\-\-use\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIORG\fR> <\fINAME\fR> 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Save a template (placeholders: {{title}} {{org.name}} {{org.description}} {{content}} {{css}} {{assets}} {{base}})
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-home\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Muninn home directory (default ~/.muninn)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_HOME\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-html\fR \fI<HTML>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-css\fR \fI<CSS>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Database file (default <home>/storage/muninn.database)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_DB\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR
Never prompt; missing values are errors
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_NON_INTERACTIVE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-use\fR
Use it for the org\*(Aqs site
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
More output (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print nothing but errors and requested data
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_QUIET\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Answer yes to every confirmation
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_YES\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR \fI<THEME_MODE>\fR
Override the theme mode for this run
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
light
.IP \(bu 2
dark
.IP \(bu 2
system
.RE
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_THEME_MODE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIORG\fR>

.TP
<\fINAME\fR>

.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH VERSION
v2.15.0
